WEBVTT

00:02:30.104 --> 00:02:34.942
And I know the power
and the beauty of these worlds

00:02:34.942 --> 00:02:38.779
because I have my own
that's more than ten years old.

00:02:39.614 --> 00:02:41.741
This is my world.

00:02:42.658 --> 00:02:47.705
After many years of playing,
developing, thinking

00:02:47.747 --> 00:02:50.166
and even dreaming about Minecraft,

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:53.085
I have gained some
experience and learnings.

00:02:53.461 --> 00:02:57.715
Watching our community use the game
in so many different ways

00:02:57.757 --> 00:03:01.636
made me realize how powerful
metaverses can be.